    "summary": "The change adds a reviewer calibration module that loads known cases, fingerprints the verifier prompt and cases, runs the production gate.verify call through a supplied gateway, caches per-model results, and determines whether a model may review. It wires `aios models calibrate ...` into the CLI with per-judgment and summary output, persists results, and returns exit code 0 only when every model passes. Tests cover case loading, fingerprinting, run behavior including repeated calls, error handling, cache invalidation by age and fingerprint, preservation of other models' entries, CLI output/exit codes, and gateway privacy configuration, and the full test suite and compileall checks pass.",
